#, no-wrap
msgid "DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: raw/iproute2/man8/ss.8:13
msgid ""
"B<ss> is used to dump socket statistics. It allows showing information "
"similar to I<netstat>.  It can display more TCP and state information than "
"other tools."
msgstr ""

#. type: SH
#: raw/iproute2/man8/ss.8:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "OPTIONS"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: raw/iproute2/man8/ss.8:17
msgid ""
"When no option is used ss displays a list of open non-listening sockets (e."
"g. TCP/UNIX/UDP) that have established connections."
msgstr ""

